Universal Declaration of Human Rights
  franc builds its trigram profiles from translations of the Universal
  Declaration of Human Rights collected by the UDHR in Unicode project
  (https://unicode.org/udhr/). Any trigram data in this repository is
  derived from franc-min 6.2.0 and therefore from that corpus.
